mina: I first met Jose 15 years ago, When her family moved into the house next door
mina: I remember that day like it was yesturday
mina: I was playing on the porch when I saw a huge track pass by and stop right next to my house
mina: Like any other child, I was intrigued
mina: So I ran closer to see
mina: And there she was...
mina: Like a Angel from the sky
mina: Blue hair that shimmered like the oceans at the beach on a beautiful day, Bright eys that sparkled with innocence and curiosity
mina: And a smile that could light up the world
mina: She truly was the prettiest girl I had ever seen.....

jose: Hii

n: Oh hi, how are you?

jose: I'm fine
jose: My name is Josephine but everyone calls me Jose, I'm new here so I hope we can be frineds

n: Sure I'd....love to

veronica: MINAA!!
veronica: You sneaky litle kid running off when you have work to do

n: AHHH, Bye Jose! I'll see you another time

mina: I ran back home and got beaten by my mom
mina: But I did not care because I made a new friend...The most beutiful frined in the world
mina: That night, I convinced my parents to invite the new neighbours for dinner
mina: But my mom seemed...off, But I was too young to understand why
mina: All I cared about was being with Josephine, She sat next to me at the table
mina: She was so polite and well mannered and her parents were kind as well
mina: We ate dinner together and after that I invited Josephine to my room

mina: Come one, Josephine let me show you my room

mina: I grabbed her arm and dragged her upstairs, we played together all night long
mina: And from that night on....We were inseperable
mina: Years passed and we grew up together, And I was always there for her
mina: But when we started 6th grade....everything changed
mina: I saw her differently, she was'nt just my best friend anymore...
mina: She was someone I loved, Someone I wanted to protect, Someone I wanted to be with forever
mina: But I was afraid
mina: What if she did not feel the same? What if I ruined everything
mina: So I chose to do nothing

mina: I began going to the gym to build muscle and become stronger, I wanted to protect her from everyone and be the only person she needed
mina: I followed her everywhere and scared away anyone who tried to get close to her
mina: I treated her like a princess so that she would not need love from anyone else
mina: I thought she was mine, That if I loved her enough she would eventually love me back
mina: Then it happened

mina: Jose began having mental health issues and was later hospitalized for a year
mina: That was the last year of primary school and the longest year of my life
mina: Luckily that did not affect her studies and she was able to move onto highschool
mina: But when she returned she had changed
mina: She no longer dressed as a tomboy and decided to fully identify as a male
mina: She wanted me to use he/him pronouns despite knowing the truth
mina: And I hated it, I hated seeing my Goddess turn into something I could no longer recognize

mina: But I had to play along, Because if I did'nt...
mina: I might lose her forever
mina: Highschool had ended and we decided to go to university together, We were still inseperable
mina: Everyone thought we were dating and I let them believe it
mina: Because that was the closest I would ever be to having her

mina: Then came the 3rd of June 2026
mina: The day everything shattered...

jose: MINAA!! Wake up!!! We're going to be late for class
mina: I opened my eyes
mina: She was looking at me from beside my bed
mina: She was already dressed, her smile was bright...a little too bright

What will you do
- Wake Up
	n: Okay! Okay! I'm waking up!
	mina: I jumped out of bed, I could not be late, not today
	mina: That day was her birthday and I had a plan...
	mina: I had planned to confess to her
	jose: Thank God for once you actually listened!
	mina: Happy Birthday, Josephine
	jose: Aww you remember, But hurry up we're going to be late
- Sleep More
	n: Let me sleep a bit more...I'm tired
	mina: I was'nt tired I was scared, It was the day I was going to confess
	jose: There's no time to sleep, Mina we're going to be late for our classes
	n: I completely forgot about that....
	mina: I had scrambled out of bed almost ruining everything, I had to tell her today
	n: Happy Birthday by the way
	jose: Thanks! Now hurry up

mina: I began to dress quickly and leave the house, Josephine was outside waiting for me amd we began running to class
mina: And during that time we had our usual conversation. SHe spoke for minutes on end and I became bored of what she was saying
mina: Until one sentence made me snap back into all of it

jose: I have a girlfriend now

n: What?, When?, How did this happen?

jose: We met on a dating app called Bu Xiang Ni
jose: He took me out 3 days ago and I could'nt tell you since you were busy at the gym all day

mina: 3 Days and she was already dating someone
mina: 3 Days and everything I have built over the years and spent time protecting broken

What do you say
- I'm happy for you
	n: I'm...I'm really happy for you Josephine
	n: Really I am
	mina: I lied through my teeth my heart was bleeding but I smiled because maybe that's what she wanted
	If she was happy then maybe...that was enough
	jump route_choice/
- Don't trust anyone you meet online
	n: Jose...don't trust anyone you meet online you don't know who he really is
	jose: Mina don't be like that, He's not like that
	n: How do you know? You've only known him for 3 days
	jose: Because when I'm with him, I feel like myself
	jose: The real me and don't you want me to be happy
	mina: I wanted her to be happy but not with someone who is not me
	mina: Not some stranger especially some random...girl!
	n: ...I just don't want you to get hurt
	jose: I wont because Ruby would not hurt me
	mina: she said it with such conviction as if she had known him her entire life and I have never been there for her
